	<h5 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: xx-small;"><span style="font-size: small;"><strong><a style="font-size: 1.5em;" title="Alu-Rahmen und Zubeh&ouml;r" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/"><span style="color: #000080;">Aluminium-Norm-Profilmatten / Aluminium-Norm-Rahmen</span></a></strong></span><strong style="font-size: 1.5em;"><a style="font-size: 1.5em;" title="Alu-Rahmen und Zubeh&ouml;r" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/"><br /></a></strong></span><span style="color: #339966; font-size: medium;">Standardgr&ouml;&szlig;en - ab Lager lieferbar</span><span style="color: #008000;"><br /></span><span style="color: #000080;">3&nbsp;Jahre Gew&auml;hrleistung nach unseren AGB</span><span style="color: #0000ff;"><br /><span style="color: #ff0000;"><em><em><em><em><em><em><span style="color: #ff0000;"><a href="/aluminium_profilmatten/rahmen_und_zubehoer#artikel_Aluminium-Winkelprofil-Rahmen">(zur&uuml;ck zu Winkel-Profilrahmen)</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></em></em></em></em></em></em></span></span><span style="color: #ff0000;"><em><em><em><em><em><em><span style="color: #ff0000;"><a title="Aluminium-Profilmatten" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/">(zur&uuml;ck zu Aluminium-Profilmatten)</a></span></em></em></em></em></em></em></span></h5>
<div class="row row-flex row-flex-wrap">
<div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-md-3">
<div class="thumbnail">
<h1 class="text-center"><span style="color: #000080;"><a title="Aluminium-Profilmatten in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ma-a/"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #333333;"><strong><em><span style="color: #000080;">Diplomat 522 R Norm<br /></span><span style="color: #000080;">Alu-Profilmatte</span></em></strong></span> </span></a></span></h1>
<a title="Aluminium-Profilmatten in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ma-a/"><img title="Aluminium-Profilmatten und Original Ripseinlagen in Standardabmessungen. Kurze Lieferzeiten" src="/media/bild/Dip-R.jpg" alt="Aluminium-Profilmatten und Original Ripseinlagen in Standardabmessungen. Kurze Lieferzeiten" width="512" height="340" /></a>
<div class="caption" style="text-align: center;"><a href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ma-a/"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #333333;"><strong><em><span style="color: #000080;">Norm-Aluminium-Profil<br />Matte&nbsp;</span><span style="color: #000080;">Diplomat, Typ 522R</span> </em></strong></span></span></span></span></a><br /><a href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ma-a/"><span> <span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000080;">Die Erfolgreiche mit wechselbarer</span></span></span><span style="color: #000080;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000080;">Einlage.<br />F&uuml;r Wohn- und<br /></span></span></span></span><span><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000080;">Gesch&auml;ftsgeb&auml;ude mit mittlerer</span></span></span><span style="color: #000080;">&nbsp;</span></span><span><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000080;">Frequentierung.<br />Besonders&nbsp;f&uuml;r</span> </span></span></span><span style="color: #0000ff;"><span style="color: #000080;">die Aufnahme<br />von Feinschmutz.</span><br /> <span style="color: #ff0000;">optimal auch f&uuml;r &uuml;berdachte</span><br /> <span style="color: #ff0000;">Haus- und Terasseneing&auml;nge<br /></span></span><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000000;"><strong><span style="color: #000080;">Mattenabmessungen</span><br /><span style="color: #000080;">Breite x Tiefe</span> </strong><br /> <span style="color: #000080;">587 mm&nbsp;x&nbsp;389 mm<br /></span></span></span></span><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #333333;"><span style="color: #000080;">787&nbsp;mm x&nbsp;489 mm<br /></span></span></span></span></span><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #333333;"><span style="color: #000080;">887&nbsp;mm</span>&nbsp;x&nbsp;<span style="color: #000080;">589 mm<br /></span></span></span></span></span><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #333333;"><span style="color: #000080;">987&nbsp;mm</span> x&nbsp;<span style="color: #000080;">589 mm<br /></span></span></span></span></span><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #333333;" data-mce-mark="1"><span style="color: #000080;">987 mm x 787 m<br /></span><span style="color: #000080;">987 mm x 987 m<br /></span><span style="color: #000080;">1187 mm x 787 mm<br /></span></span></span></span></a><span style="color: #ff0000;"><span style="color: #ff0000;"><a title="Aluminium-Profilmatten in Wunsch-Gr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/52601-a">Sondergr&ouml;&szlig;en</a><br /></span></span>
<div class="text-right"><a class="btn btn-info" title="Aluminium-Profilmatten" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ma-a/">zum Artikel</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-md-3">
<div class="thumbnail" style="text-align: center;">
<h1 class="text-center"><span style="color: #000080;"><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #333333;"><strong><strong><em><span style="color: #000080;">Aluminium-Norm-Rahmen</span> <span style="color: #000080;">500N</span></em></strong></strong></span></span></a></span></h1>
<a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><img title="Aluminium-Normrahmen f&uuml;r Aluminium-Profilmatten" src="/media/bild/Alu-Rahmen-512x340.jpg" alt="Aluminium-Normrahmen f&uuml;r Aluminium-Profilmatten" width="512" height="340" /></a><a title="Aluminium-Mattenrahmen" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522r-norm-rahmen/"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #333333;"><em><strong><br /></strong></em></span></span></span></a><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #333333;"><em><strong><span style="color: #000080;">Aluminium-Profil-</span><br /><span style="color: #000080;">Norm-Rahmen, Typ 500N<br /></span></strong></em></span></span></span><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #333333;"><span style="color: #000080;">Rahmen-Innenh&ouml;he: 22mm<br />Rahmen-Au&szlig;enh&ouml;he: &nbsp;26,5 mm&nbsp;</span><br /></span><span style="color: #000080;">fertig montiert<br /></span><span style="color: #333333;"><span style="color: #000080;">wird </span><span style="color: #000080;">je nach Mattengr&ouml;&szlig;e<br /></span><span style="color: #000080;">ohne, bzw. mit </span><br /><span style="color: #000080;">Mauerankern geliefert.</span></span></span></span></a><a href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522r-norm-rahmen/"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #333333;"><br /><br /></span></span></span></a><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000000;"><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><strong><span style="color: #000080;">Rahmen-Au&szlig;enabmessungen</span><br /><span style="color: #000080;">Breite x Tiefe </span></strong><br /></a><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><span style="color: #000080;">&nbsp; 600</span> <span style="color: #000080;">mm x&nbsp; 400&nbsp;mm</span></a><br /><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><span style="color: #000080;">&nbsp; 800 mm x&nbsp; 500 mm</span></a></span></span><br /><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000080;"> <span style="color: #000000;">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000080;">900 mm x&nbsp; 600 mm</span></span></a><br /><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000080;"> <span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000080;">1000 mm</span> <span style="color: #000080;">x&nbsp; 600 mm</span></span></span></span></a><br /><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000080;"> <span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000080;">1000</span> <span style="color: #000080;">mm x&nbsp; 800 mm</span></span></span></span></a><br /> <span style="color: #333333;"><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #000000;">&nbsp;<span style="color: #000080;">1000 mm</span> <span style="color: #000080;">x 1000 mm</span></span></span></a><br /><span style="color: #000080;"><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"> <span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #000080;">1200</span>&nbsp;<span style="color: #000080;">mm</span>&nbsp;</span>x&nbsp;&nbsp;800 mm</a></span><a title="Aluminium-Winkelprofil-Rahmen in Wunschgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/rahmen_und_zubehoer"><br /> <span style="color: #ff0000;">Sondergr&ouml;&szlig;en</span></a>&nbsp;</span>
<div class="caption" style="text-align: center;">
<div class="text-right"><a class="btn btn-info" title="Aluminium-Matten-Normrahmen" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/">zum Artikel</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-md-3">
