<h1 class="text-center"><span style="color: #000080;"><a title="Aluminium-Vollprofil-Rahmen in Normgr&ouml;&szlig;en" href="/aluminium_profilmatten/522RN-Ra-a/"><span style="color: #000080;"><span style="color: #333333;"><strong><em><span style="color: #000080;">Kombination-Norm<br />522 R + 500</span> <span style="color: #000080;">N</span></em></strong></span></span></a></span></h1>
