<div class="text-center"><span style="color: #000080;"><a href="logomatten/6304020"><span style="color: #000080;">1 Satz (4 St&uuml;ck) = 131,74&euro; </span></a></span><span style="color: #000080;"><a href="logomatten/6304020"><span style="color: #000080;">inkl.MWSt,</span></a></span></div>
